text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Discover the ultimate collection of fish names organized by type, color, and personality. From betta fish to goldfish, find the perfect name for your aquatic pet.\"}]]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"vintage-retro-pet-names-throwback\",{\"href\":\"/blog/vintage-retro-pet-names-throwback/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🕰️\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Pet Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Vintage Pet Names: 100+ Throwback Ideas That Never Go Out of Style 🕰️\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Discover 100+ vintage and retro pet names from the 1920s through 1970s. Classic, timeless names for dogs, cats, and all pets that carry charm, history, and enduring style.\"}]]}]\n1a:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n17:null\n1c:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Seasonal Pet Names: 100+ Ideas for Winter, Summer, Spring & Fall Pets ❄️☀️🍂🌸\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover 100+ seasonal pet names inspired by winter snow, summer sun, autumn harvest, and spring blooms. Perfect for pets born in or adopted during your favorite season.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"seasonal pet names, winter pet names, summer pet names, autumn pet names, spring pet names\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"co